	["Bring 4 Carved Stone Urns to Prospector Ironband in Loch Modan."] = "Lleva 4 urnas de piedra labrada al prospector Vetaferro, en Loch Modan.",
	["Bring 4 Gromsblood, 10 Giant Silver Veins and Nagmara's Filled Vial to Mistress Nagmara in Blackrock Depths."] = "Llévale 4 gromsanguinas, 10 vetas gigantes de plata y el vial lleno de Nagmara a la coima Nagmara en las Profundidades de Roca Negra.",
