	["Every 15 to 25 seconds he spins for 10 seconds, hitting everyone near him. Melee, step back until it ends."] = "Cada 15 a 25 s gira durante 10 s y golpea a todos los que tiene cerca. Los de cuerpo a cuerpo, apartaos hasta que termine.",
	["Every 15 to 25 seconds he whirls for 10 seconds, hitting everyone near him: melee, step back until it ends."] = "Cada 15 a 25 s gira durante 10 s y golpea a todos los que tiene cerca: los de cuerpo a cuerpo, apartaos hasta que termine.",
	["Every 21 to 35 seconds he strikes a player other than his target, who falls as if dead and can neither attack nor cast. Moving ends it."] = "Cada 21 a 35 s golpea a un jugador que no sea su objetivo, que cae como muerto y no puede atacar ni lanzar hechizos. Moverse lo anula.",
	["Every 25 to 31 seconds: hits everyone near him and stuns them for 2.5 seconds."] = "Cada 25 a 31 s: golpea a todos los que tiene cerca y los aturde durante 2,5 s.",
	["Every 8 to 14 seconds: Nature damage to everyone near him, and their attacks and movement are slowed for 10 seconds."] = "Cada 8 a 14 s: daño de Naturaleza a todos los que tiene cerca, y sus ataques y su movimiento se ralentizan durante 10 s.",
	["Every 9 to 15 seconds she is immune to all attacks and spells for 2 seconds."] = "Cada 9 a 15 s es inmune a todos los ataques y hechizos durante 2 s.",
	["Every few seconds, Arcane damage to everyone within 10 yards. Ranged players, keep your distance."] = "Cada pocos segundos, daño Arcano a todos los que estén a menos de 10 m. Jugadores a distancia, mantened la distancia.",
