	["Idol of Hakkar, inside the dungeon"] = "Ídolo de Hakkar, dentro de la mazmorra",
	["If someone leaves the room during the fight, he resets to full health."] = "Si alguien sale de la sala durante el combate, se reinicia con la salud al máximo.",
	["If you agree to aid Belnistrasz, speak with him again and hand the Oathstone he gave you back to him."] = "Si decides ayudar a Belnistrasz, habla con él otra vez y devuélvele la piedra de juramento que te dio.",
