	["Infected Wound"] = "Herida infectada",
	["Insert a Grime-Encrusted Object into the Sparklematic 5200, with three silver coins to start the machine."] = "Introduce un Objeto con mugre incrustada en la Chispamática 5200, con tres monedas de plata para poner en marcha la máquina.",
	["Inside a vault in the Reliquary of Kings (Durgen Dirgehammer's room)"] = "En una cámara del Relicario de los Reyes (la sala de Durgen Martillo Fúnebre)",
	["Inside Stratholme, where the Keepsake of Remembrance is placed."] = "Dentro de Stratholme, donde se coloca el Recuerdo de Evocación.",
	["Inside the dungeon."] = "Dentro de la mazmorra.",
	["Inside the dungeon; needs Mining 230."] = "Dentro de la mazmorra; requiere Minería (230).",
	["Interrupt her Chain Bolt. Every so often she is immune for 2 seconds, and a priest or a shaman can remove her Renew."] = "Interrumpe su Descarga en cadena. De vez en cuando es inmune durante 2 s, y un sacerdote o un chamán puede quitarle Renovar.",
	["Interrupt her Holy Smite and her heals; a priest or a shaman can remove her shield."] = "Interrumpe su Castigo sagrado y sus curaciones; un sacerdote o un chamán puede quitarle el escudo.",
	["Interrupt his Chain Lightning. A priest or a shaman can remove his Bloodlust."] = "Interrumpe su Cadena de relámpagos. Un sacerdote o un chamán puede quitarle Ansia de sangre.",
	["Interrupt his Chained Bolt, which jumps to a second player."] = "Interrumpe su Descarga en cadena, que salta a un segundo jugador.",
	["Interrupt his Fear and, at 30% health, his heal. He puts everyone near him to sleep (damage wakes a sleeper), and a mage or a druid can remove his Curse of Blood."] = "Interrumpe su Miedo y, con un 30% de salud, su curación. Duerme a todos los que tiene cerca (el daño despierta a quien duerme), y un mago o un druida puede quitar su Maldición de sangre.",
	["Interrupt his Healing Touch. Thunderclap slows everyone near him."] = "Interrumpe su Toque de sanación. Atronar ralentiza a todos los que tiene cerca.",
	["Interrupt his Holy Light. Divine Shield makes him immune for 10 seconds, and he stuns with Hammer of Justice."] = "Interrumpe su Luz Sagrada. Escudo divino lo vuelve inmune durante 10 s, y aturde con Martillo de justicia.",
	["Interrupt his Immolate or dispel the burn. A mage or a druid can remove his Curse of Weakness."] = "Interrumpe su Inmolar o disipa la quemadura. Un mago o un druida puede quitar su Maldición de debilidad.",
	["Interrupt his Lightning Bolt and Healing Touch. Below 30% health his serpent form hits harder and puts players to sleep."] = "Interrumpe su Descarga de relámpagos y su Toque de sanación. Por debajo del 30% de salud, en forma de serpiente golpea más fuerte y duerme a los jugadores.",
	["Interrupt his Molten Metal, which burns and slows."] = "Interrumpe su Metal fundido, que quema y ralentiza.",
	["Interrupt his slow Healing Touch and his Lightning Bolt."] = "Interrumpe su lento Toque de sanación y su Descarga de relámpagos.",
	["Interrupt his Void Bolt. He teleports between his ledges, and stuns everyone around him when the tank reaches him."] = "Interrumpe su Descarga abisal. Se teletransporta entre sus cornisas y aturde a todos a su alrededor cuando el tanque llega hasta él.",
	["Interrupt or dispel his Dominate Mind, which takes over a player; interrupt his Shadow Bolt."] = "Interrumpe o disipa su Dominar mente, con la que controla a un jugador; interrumpe su Descarga de las Sombras.",
	["Interrupt or dispel his Polymorph. His Silence reaches 15 yards: healers, stand back."] = "Interrumpe o disipa su Polimorfia. Su Silencio alcanza 15 m: sanadores, manteneos lejos.",
	["Interrupt or dispel his Soul Drain, which roots a player and drains their health."] = "Interrumpe o disipa su Drenaje de alma, que enraíza a un jugador y le drena la salud.",
