	["Kill 10 Defias Prisoners, 8 Defias Convicts, and 8 Defias Insurgents inside The Stockade."] = "Mata a 10 prisioneros Defias, 8 presidiarios Defias y 8 insurgentes Defias en las Mazmorras.",
	["Kill 15 Enraged Apparitions and 10 Tormented Souls, then put Anvilmar's spirit to rest."] = "Mata a 15 apariciones enfurecidas y 10 almas atormentadas, y luego da descanso al espíritu de Yunquemar.",
	["Kill 20 Plagued Hatchlings, then return to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel."] = "Mata a 20 crías de dragón apestadas y vuelve con Betina Bigglezink a la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz.",
	["Kill 7 Deviate Ravagers, 7 Deviate Vipers, 7 Deviate Shamblers and 7 Deviate Dreadfangs."] = "Mata a 7 devastadores descarriados, 7 víboras descarriadas, 7 arrastrados descarriados y 7 colminfernos descarriados.",
	["Kill 8 Ragefire Troggs and 8 Ragefire Shamans inside Ragefire Chasm."] = "Mata a 8 troggs Furia Ardiente y 8 chamanes Furia Ardiente en la Sima Ígnea.",
	["Kill 8 Razorfen Battleguard, 8 Razorfen Thornweavers, and 8 Death's Head Cultists and return to Myriam Moonsinger near the entrance to Razorfen Downs."] = "Mata a 8 guardias de batalla de Rajacieno, 8 tejespinas de Rajacieno y 8 cultores Caramuerte, y vuelve con Myriam Lunacanta, cerca de la entrada de Zahúrda Rajacieno.",
	["Kill a Highland Horror within Excavation Sites and bring its root core to Rethiel the Greenwarden in the Wetlands."] = "Mata a un Horror de las Tierras Altas en la Excavación y lleva su núcleo de raíz a Rethiel el Guardaverde, en Los Humedales.",
	["Kill Archmage Arugal and bring his head to Dalar Dawnweaver."] = "Mata al Archimago Arugal y lleva su cabeza a Dalar Tejalba.",
	["Kill Bazil Thredd in The Stockade and bring his head back to Warden Thelwater."] = "Mata a Bazil Thredd en las Mazmorras y llévale su cabeza al alcaide Thelagua.",
	["Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker inside Ragefire Chasm."] = "Mata a Bazzalan y a Jergosh el Conjurador en la Sima Ígnea.",
	["Kill Dextren Ward in The Stockade and bring his hand to Councilman Millstipe."] = "Mata a Dextren Tutor en las Mazmorras y lleva su mano al consejero Tallolino.",
	["Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod and Houndmaster Loksey, then report to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore."] = "Mata a la alta inquisidora Melenablanca, al comandante Escarlata Mograine, a Herod y al maestro de canes Loksey, y luego preséntate ante Raleigh el Devoto en Costasur.",
	["Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod and Houndmaster Loksey, then report to Varimathras in the Undercity."] = "Mata a la alta inquisidora Melenablanca, al comandante Escarlata Mograine, a Herod y al maestro de canes Loksey, y luego preséntate ante Varimathras en Entrañas.",
	["Kill Kam Deepfury in The Stockade and bring his head to Motley Garmason."] = "Mata a Kam Furiahonda en las Mazmorras y lleva su cabeza a Motley Garmason.",
	["Kill Lady Anacondra, Lord Cobrahn, Lord Pythas and Lord Serpentis, then talk to the Disciple of Naralex at the entrance and escort him to Naralex. Protect him during the ritual: Mutanus comes at the end."] = "Mata a Lady Anacondra, Lord Cobrahn, Lord Pythas y Lord Serpentis; luego habla con el Discípulo de Naralex en la entrada y escóltalo hasta Naralex. Protégelo durante el ritual: Mutanus aparece al final.",
	["Kill Mekgineer Thermaplugg and return to High Tinker Mekkatorque."] = "Mata al mekigeniero Termochufe y vuelve con el alto mecachifle Mekkatorque.",
