	["Take a shard of the Felvine once Alzzin the Wildshaper falls, seal it in the Reliquary of Purity and bring it to Rabine Saturna."] = "Coge un fragmento de gangrevid cuando caiga Alzzin el Formaferal, guárdalo en el relicario de pureza y llévaselo a Rabine Saturna.",
