	["Take the Azure Key, which Morphaz carries, to Lord Jorach Ravenholdt."] = "Quítale a Morphaz la llave azur y llévasela a Lord Jorach Ravenholdt.",
	["Take the bad news back to King Magni Bronzebeard in Ironforge."] = "Regresa a Forjaz y dale las malas noticias al rey Magni Barbabronce.",
