	["Three hounds stand at his side and attack with him, and he gives them Bloodlust too. Kill them first."] = "Tres sabuesos lo acompañan y atacan con él, y también a ellos les da Ansia de sangre. Mátalos primero.",
	["Three Kings of Flame"] = "Tres reyes de Fuego",
	["Throws the tank into the air and stuns him for 5 seconds. Damage dealers, watch your threat: the tank is on him only about half the fight."] = "Lanza al tanque por los aires y lo aturde durante 5 s. DPS, vigilad vuestra amenaza: el tanque solo lo tiene encima más o menos la mitad del combate.",
	["Thun'grim Firegaze"] = "Thun'grim Vistafuego",
