	["What Tomorrow Brings"] = "Lo que nos depara el futuro",
	["Wheel of the Black March"] = "Rueda de la Marcha Negra",
	["When he dies, 20 Scarlet Trainees run in through the hall's door and attack. Stay together and use area damage."] = "Cuando muere, 20 practicantes Escarlata entran corriendo por la puerta de la sala y atacan. Manteneos juntos y usad daño en área.",
	["When he dies, twenty Scarlet Trainees rush in through the hall's door: stay together and use area damage."] = "Cuando muere, veinte practicantes Escarlata irrumpen por la puerta de la sala: manteneos juntos y usad daño en área.",
	["When his health gets low he fears the whole group. Bring a way to break it, or clear the room first so nobody runs into more enemies."] = "Cuando le queda poca salud, atemoriza a todo el grupo. Lleva algo para romper el miedo, o limpia antes la sala para que nadie se tope con más enemigos.",
	["When his mana runs dry he turns the whole group into animals for 8 seconds, then channels Evocation to refill it. Casters can hide behind the wall from the polymorph, but if anyone leaves the room he resets to full health."] = "Cuando se queda sin maná, convierte a todo el grupo en animales durante 8 s y luego canaliza Evocación para recuperarlo. Los lanzadores de hechizos pueden esconderse de la polimorfia tras la pared, pero si alguien sale de la sala, se reinicia con la salud al máximo.",
	["When his mana runs out, he turns the whole group into animals for 8 seconds, then channels Evocation for 6 seconds to refill it."] = "Cuando se le acaba el maná, convierte a todo el grupo en animales durante 8 s y luego canaliza Evocación durante 6 s para recuperarlo.",
	["When his target is close he knocks down and roots everyone near him: ranged players, keep your distance."] = "Cuando su objetivo está cerca, derriba y enraíza a todos a su alrededor: jugadores a distancia, no os acerquéis.",
	["When his target is close, he knocks down and roots everyone near him for 10 seconds. Ranged players, keep your distance."] = "Cuando su objetivo está cerca, derriba y enraíza durante 10 s a todos a su alrededor. Jugadores a distancia, no os acerquéis.",
	["When Mograine falls he is only playing dead: she runs out of the room behind the altar and attacks."] = "Cuando Mograine cae, solo se hace el muerto: ella sale corriendo de la sala de detrás del altar y ataca.",
	["When Mograine falls he is only playing dead: she runs out of the room behind the altar."] = "Cuando Mograine cae, solo se hace el muerto: ella sale corriendo de la sala de detrás del altar.",
	["When pulled he calls every Scarlet defender within 80 yards: clear the cathedral first."] = "Al atraerlo, llama a todos los defensores Escarlata en un radio de 80 m: limpia antes la catedral.",
	["When pulled he calls everything within 30 yards: clear around him first. He hits harder at 60%, 40% and 20% health."] = "Al atraerlo, llama a todo lo que haya a menos de 30 m: limpia antes la zona que lo rodea. Golpea más fuerte al 60%, 40% y 20% de salud.",
	["When pulled, he calls every Scarlet defender within 80 yards to join him. Clear the cathedral before you pull him."] = "Al atraerlo, llama a todos los defensores Escarlata en un radio de 80 m para que se le unan. Limpia la catedral antes de atraerlo.",
	["When pulled, he calls the creatures within 15 yards to join him, the two Razorfen Spearhides at his side among them. Crowd-control one of them."] = "Al atraerlo, llama a las criaturas que haya en 15 m para que se unan a él, incluidos los dos cuerolanzas de Rajacieno que lo acompañan. Controla a uno de ellos.",
	["When pulled, he calls the creatures within 30 yards to join him. Clear around him first."] = "Al atraerlo, llama a las criaturas que haya a menos de 30 m para que se le unan. Limpia antes la zona que lo rodea.",
	["When the tank reaches him: Nature damage and a 5-second stun around him."] = "Cuando el tanque llega hasta él: daño de Naturaleza y aturdimiento de 5 s a su alrededor.",
	["Where the demigod Agamaggan fell, his blood grew into a sprawl of giant thorns, and the quilboar made it their sacred home. Undead envoys have lately been seen among them, and Charlga Razorflank rules the Kraul from its heart."] = "Donde cayó el semidiós Agamaggan, su sangre se convirtió en una maraña de espinos gigantes, y los jabaespines hicieron de ella su hogar sagrado. Últimamente se han visto emisarios no-muertos entre ellos, y Charlga Filonavaja gobierna el Horado desde su corazón.",
	["Whoever strikes him or an ally near him, Overlord Ramtusk included, takes Nature damage."] = "Quien lo golpee a él o a un aliado cercano, incluido el señor supremo Colmicarnero, recibe daño de Naturaleza.",
	["Wilder Thistlenettle"] = "Wilder Cardortiga",
	["Wilder Thistlenettle, Stormwind"] = "Wilder Cardortiga, Ventormenta",
